 Institute, the 🇩🇪 Information Security Office BSI explored approaches to AI evaluation &amp; secure use. They also shared 🇩🇪 experience implementing NIS2 to protect critical infrastructure. https://t.co/FgGl9ha1DA", "url": "https://x.com/GermanyInOz/status/2117068011190505568"}, {"author_id": "2104187067081404416", "created_at": "2026-11-03T05:53:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117495286750961992"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The Digital Trust Centre (DTC), which also houses the Singapore AI Safety Institute, is Singapore's national hub for research and development in trust technologies, including AI Safety.", "display_url": "ntu.edu.sg/dtc", "end": 270, "expanded_url": "https://www.ntu.edu.sg/dtc", "images": [{"height": 465, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117495290718806016/DaVs8Qm7?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 775}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117495290718806016/DaVs8Qm7?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 247, "status": 200, "title": "Home", "unwound_url": "https://www.ntu.edu.sg/dtc", "url": "https://t.co/00q3mPdc8u"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/E7ES2eWk5S", "end": 294, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SI_Singapore/status/2117495286750961992/photo/1", "media_key": "16_2117495226432688128", "start": 271, "url": "https://t.co/E7ES2eWk5S"}, {"display_url": "x.com/AnthropicAI/st…", "end": 318, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/AnthropicAI/status/2117343929960112486", "start": 295, "url": "https://t.co/MAaV4ijGQ8"}]}, "id": "2117495286750961992", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117343929960112486", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Anthropic's Residency (6 wks to 6 mo, US/UK) brings senior technical leaders into AI safety. No ML background required.\n\nIn the SI ecosystem, NTU's Digital Trust Centre hosts Singapore's AI Safety Institute. SI view: SG could use a local on-ramp.\nhttps://t.co/00q3mPdc8u https://t.co/E7ES2eWk5S https://t.co/MAaV4ijGQ8", "url": "https://x.com/SI_Singapore/status/2117495286750961992"}, {"author_id": "2002214728983326721", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:51:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117238064187908530"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/4O9va7hUfa", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/PolyokeyMoney/status/2117238064187908530/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117238056868810752", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/4O9va7hUfa"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/4O9va7hUfa", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/PolyokeyMoney/status/2117238064187908530/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117238056906534912", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/4O9va7hUfa"}]}, "id": "2117238064187908530", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 98, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "🧵 Frontier AI labs are panicking over the EU AI Act audits ⚠️\n\nThe EU AI Office is investigating 30+ AI giants: OpenAI, Google, Meta, Anthropic 🤖\nThis is active enforcement, not just a consultation 🔍\n\nGPAI rules took effect August 2, 2026.\nRegulators review these items:\n✅ https://t.co/4O9va7hUfa", "url": "https://x.com/PolyokeyMoney/status/2117238064187908530"}, {"author_id": "1417134909513244673", "created_at": "2026-11-03T16:31:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117655962131546525"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/bMZc4dugpr", "end": 292, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/5DWorlds/status/2117655962131546525/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117655916619223040", "start": 269, "url": "https://t.co/bMZc4dugpr"}]}, "id": "2117655962131546525", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🇩🇪 GERMANY · 🟢 Stable · tension 34%\n\n👑 ⚪ Kb1 · Diplomacy · Calm\nGermany ties AI safety institute to Canada as Merz urges speed\n🧪 Fake-o-meter: 🟡 Corroborated — irregular move · 3 outlets\n♟ Move parity: ⚠️ Irregular move — other outlets place this story on f1 (white)\n🔗 https://t.co/bMZc4dugpr", "url": "https://x.com/5DWorlds/status/2117655962131546525"}, {"author_id": "1524014263068680192", "created_at": "2026-11-02T18:36:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117325080845844768"], "id": "2117325080845844768", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 110, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "What are the safety risks of physical AI?\n\nMost discussion of AI risk is about language models. Robots get far less attention, even though a robot acts in the physical world, where a failure can damage property or hurt someone. Together with the Physical AI Safety Institute, we", "url": "https://x.com/MITFutureTech/status/2117325080845844768"}, {"author_id": "637164010", "created_at": "2026-11-03T17:14:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117666669011108177"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/derleomartin/s…", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/derleomartin/status/2117323665880633711", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/kmN69Md3NO"}]}, "id": "2117666669011108177", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117323665880633711", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Leonard's read of Germany's AI Taskforce report, in one line: big 2030 goals, and the plan is mostly a monitoring structure.\n\nThe numbers he pulls out:\n- €30.7M for new AI compute by 2030. AWS alone is putting €4.8B into its Frankfurt region next year.\n- Grid connections in https://t.co/kmN69Md3NO", "url": "https://x.com/unclejoe_666/status/2117666669011108177"}, {"author_id": "77606200", "created_at": "2026-11-03T15:30:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117640673692373325"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/aob54SBcPm", "end": 186, "expanded_